After every AI code completion make a git commit with proper git message.
Add a proper brief comment on each functions and complex hook usages.

**Production test rule (unit + Cypress):** (1) Tests must only delete/modify folders or files that the test itself created. (2) Do not add: delete folder, permanent delete, batch delete from /documents page, or delete/trash of existing attachments/documents. (3) The only deletion allowed is deleting the file(s) that the same test created. (4) When a test includes deletion, the deletion flow must come last—after every other operation in that test. (5) Do not visit or add E2E steps for: edit-requests, signatures, notifications, permissions (to be implemented later). Allowed: read-only flows and stubbed data.
